WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.781
The twelve-house tarot spread places twelve cards
in a ring, one for each area of life.

00:00:06.781 --> 00:00:11.208
It borrows astrology's structure but needs
no knowledge of astrology.

00:00:12.508 --> 00:00:14.278
Where the layout comes from.

00:00:14.278 --> 00:00:23.700
In astrology, a birth chart is a circle divided into twelve sections called
houses, each associated with a theme such as home, work or relationships.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.596
The twelve positions.

00:00:26.596 --> 00:00:32.674
Self, money and values, communication,
home and roots, then creativity and play.

00:00:33.974 --> 00:00:35.009
Reading the wheel.

00:00:35.009 --> 00:00:38.688
Start by reading each card against its
house, and keep it brief.

00:00:40.088 --> 00:00:42.362
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:42.362 --> 00:00:46.973
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
